// {"files":[{"path":"\\\\?\\C:\\Users\\danie\\OneDrive\\github-repos\\drosemann\\README.md","hunks":[{"oldStart":27,"oldLines":6,"newStart":27,"newLines":7,"lines":[" Under my old alias MineHub I published SpigotMC plugins at https://www.spigotmc.org/resources/authors/minehub.1035036/"," Since 10 September 2023 I've been part of Emergency Response: Crestwood County, a Roblox roleplay project."," I also built a Raspberry Pi AI plant monitoring project with sensors and AI, and I spend time on hardware hacking and AI security.","+I also built cooperating-screen for cross-device screen sharing with Flutter, WebRTC and a Node.js signaling service: https://github.com/drosemann/cooperating-screen"," After over 2,000 gaming videos I made 15 videos in the Theo Browne style, archived at https://github.com/drosemann/drosemann/tree/main/theo-browne-era-video-style"," All of my domains are with netcup: d5niel.de for my portfolio, which will run on ForgeCMS in the future, shadowunity.de for my Minecraft server, and hosting-club.de, a former hosting forum."," Over the years every hosting era also produced a forum or blog attempt, ten in total, and I finally merged all of them into one codebase: forum-for-nerds, a self-hosted Next.js forum plus blog running on pure Docker with SQLite for dev and MariaDB in prod. Ten dead forums walked in, one nerd forum walked out."]}]}]}
